---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---

<section class="min-h-screen flex items-center pt-16">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 w-full">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent mb-4" data-i18n="hero.greeting">Hola, soy</p>
        <h1 class="text-display-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4" data-i18n="hero.name">Fernando Figuera</h1>
        <p class="text-display-md font-medium text-text-secondary mb-6" data-i18n="hero.title">TSU en Informática · Est. Ingeniería en Sistemas</p>
        <p class="max-w-xl text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-8" data-i18n="hero.description">
          Apasionado por la tecnología y la programación. Mi objetivo es aportar y seguir desarrollando mi carrera profesional, aplicando mis conocimientos para diseñar e implementar soluciones tecnológicas innovadoras.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal order-first lg:order-none flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative shrink-0">
          <div class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-full bg-accent-muted opacity-40 blur-2xl lg:rounded-3xl lg:blur-sm"></div>
          <img
            src={`${base}Fernando.webp`}
            alt="Fernando Figuera"
            width="1705"
            height="1705"
            class="relative w-40 h-40 sm:w-44 sm:h-44 lg:w-72 lg:h-96 object-cover object-center rounded-full lg:rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-lg"
          />
          <div class="absolute bottom-1 right-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent text-white font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold shadow-lg lg:-bottom-4 lg:-right-4 lg:px-4 lg:py-2 lg:rounded-lg lg:text-xs lg:font-medium">
            &lt;dev /&gt;
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal stagger-3 flex flex-wrap gap-4 mb-16">
      <a href="#projects" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-accent text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors duration-200">
        <span data-i18n="hero.cta_projects">Ver proyectos</span>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"/><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:fefc2908@gmail.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg border border-border text-text-secondary font-medium text-sm hover:border-accent hover:text-accent transition-all duration-200">
        <span data-i18n="hero.cta_contact">Contactar</span>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
